          "Body and nature are sacred",
          "Spirit reborn in the flesh"
        ]
      },
      "line": {
        "pt": "“Para transcender o mundo, primeiro é preciso vivê-lo.”",
        "en": "“To go beyond the world, you first have to live it.”"
